{"ordinal":14769,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452329381894","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Death_05ede5a","source":"Bestson: Прости, мама…","target":"Bestson: Iartă-mă, mamă…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14770,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452329381893","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Death_0a4ccf3","source":"Bestson: Кажется, я всё испортил. Опять.","target":"Bestson: Cred că am stricat totul. Iarăși.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14771,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452329381892","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Ears_DontShoot_0e129e3","source":"Bestson: Как будто меня даже не существует.","target":"Bestson: De parcă nici n-aș exista.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14772,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452329381891","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Ears_DontShoot_0af09b0","source":"Bestson: Время проходит мимо, и я себя ощущаю так…","target":"Bestson: Timpul trece pe lângă mine și eu mă simt așa…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14773,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452329381890","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Ears_DontShoot_0998fcf","source":"Bestson: Но ничего.","target":"Bestson: Dar nu-i nimic.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14774,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452329381889","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Ears_DontShoot_05ba5bb","source":"Bestson: Что я услышу их голоса, шаги в коридоре…","target":"Bestson: Că le voi auzi vocile, pașii pe hol…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14775,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452329381888","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Ears_DontShoot_0e7bed1","source":"Bestson: Я долго ждал, что они постучат в дверь…","target":"Bestson: Am așteptat mult timp să bată la ușă…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14776,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452325187594","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Photo_DontShoot_0422606","source":"Bestson: Может, я изменился, а они бы меня даже не узнали…","target":"Bestson: Poate m-am schimbat și nici nu m-ar mai recunoaște…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14777,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452325187593","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Photo_DontShoot_07eb704","source":"Bestson: Но если моя аура отличается от родительской… может, я уже не такой, каким был?","target":"Bestson: Dar dacă aura mea e diferită de a părinților… poate nu mai sunt același om?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14778,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452325187592","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Photo_DontShoot_0929bf4","source":"Bestson: Я не знаю, честно… Я никогда не видел таких вещей.","target":"Bestson: Sincer, nu știu… N-am mai văzut niciodată lucruri de felul ăsta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14779,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452325187591","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Photo_DontShoot_0b52978","source":"Bestson: Аура правда что-то значит?","target":"Bestson: Aura chiar înseamnă ceva?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14780,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452325187590","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Photo_DontShoot_047cfd0","source":"Bestson: Начинаю чувствовать, как будто меня очень сильно сдавливают. Это вообще нормально?","target":"Bestson: Încep să simt că sunt strâns foarte tare. E normal?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14781,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452325187589","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Photo_DontShoot_0aed892","source":"Bestson: Мне не нравится это фото. Я не знаю, что с ним не так, но когда смотрю…","target":"Bestson: Nu-mi place fotografia asta. Nu știu ce e în neregulă cu ea, dar când mă uit…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14782,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452325187588","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Armpit_DontShoot_0336210","source":"Bestson: Без них… мне просто всё равно.","target":"Bestson: Fără ei… pur și simplu nu-mi mai pasă.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14783,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452325187587","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Armpit_DontShoot_019d1af","source":"Bestson: Родители говорили, что я хороший, и мне этого хватало.","target":"Bestson: Părinții îmi spuneau că sunt un băiat bun și asta îmi era de ajuns.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14784,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452325187586","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Armpit_DontShoot_04ab037","source":"Bestson: Я знаю, что многим это кажется странным, но… Меня просто никогда не беспокоило, как я выгляжу.","target":"Bestson: Știu că multora li se pare ciudat, dar… nu m-a preocupat niciodată cum arăt.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14785,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452325187585","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Armpit_DontShoot_0aa8ca2","source":"Bestson: Но если не сказали, значит, мне решать? А если я решу неправильно?..","target":"Bestson: Dar dacă nu mi-au spus, înseamnă că trebuie să hotărăsc eu? Și dacă hotărăsc greșit?..","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14786,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452325187584","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Armpit_DontShoot_033f177","source":"Bestson: А вот тут… Сейчас… Ничего об этом мне не говорили.","target":"Bestson: Iar aici… Stai puțin… Nu mi-au spus nimic despre asta.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14787,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452320993291","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Armpit_DontShoot_0b6d9f7","source":"Bestson: Если говорят, что надо умываться – значит, надо. Если говорят, что нельзя перебивать – значит, нельзя. Так ведь правильно?","target":"Bestson: Dacă îți spun să te speli pe față, trebuie să te speli. Dacă îți spun să nu întrerupi, nu întrerupi. Așa e bine, nu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14788,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452320993290","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Armpit_DontShoot_005586b","source":"Bestson: Я всегда верил, что, если делать всё, как учили, всё будет хорошо.","target":"Bestson: Am crezut mereu că, dacă fac totul cum m-au învățat, va fi bine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14789,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452320993289","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Eyes_DontShoot_0d2096f","source":"Bestson: Просто… я не умею быть один.","target":"Bestson: Doar că… nu știu să fiu singur.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14790,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452320993288","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Eyes_DontShoot_0aff210","source":"Bestson: Я не хочу плакать, правда…","target":"Bestson: Nu vreau să plâng, sincer…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14791,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452320993287","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Eyes_DontShoot_085b420","source":"Bestson: Как не плакать, когда ты один, когда никто не отвечает на звонки, когда родители просто исчезли?","target":"Bestson: Cum să nu plâng când sunt singur, când nu răspunde nimeni la telefon, când părinții pur și simplu au dispărut?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14792,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452320993286","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Eyes_DontShoot_0146cf8","source":"Bestson: Нет, ты прав… Я много плакал.","target":"Bestson: Nu, ai dreptate… Am plâns mult.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14793,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452320993285","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Eyes_DontShoot_0880498","source":"Bestson: А папа… папа выбирал один. Смотрел прямо, не отводя. Интересно, какой бы он выбрал сейчас?..","target":"Bestson: Iar tata… tata alegea un ochi. Privea drept în el, fără să-și abată privirea. Mă întreb pe care l-ar alege acum?..","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14794,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452320993284","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Eyes_DontShoot_0dd2089","source":"Bestson: Мама, когда разговаривала со мной, то в один глаз смотрела, то в другой. Быстро-быстро! Туда-сюда!","target":"Bestson: Când vorbea cu mine, mama se uita când într-un ochi, când în celălalt. Repede-repede! Într-o parte și-n alta!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14795,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452320993283","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_DontShoot_0dc58b8","source":"Bestson: Ты ведь не осудишь меня за это?","target":"Bestson: N-o să mă judeci pentru asta, nu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14796,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452320993282","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_DontShoot_0cbd302","source":"Bestson: Иногда просто сжимаю кулаки, бью по стене. Всё лучше, чем просто сидеть.","target":"Bestson: Uneori îmi strâng pumnii și lovesc peretele. E mai bine decât să stau degeaba.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14797,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452320993281","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_DontShoot_0024990","source":"Bestson: Но когда я один, когда жду их возвращения, но никто так и не приходит… не знаю, что делать.","target":"Bestson: Dar când sunt singur și aștept să se întoarcă, iar ei nu mai vin… nu știu ce să fac.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14798,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452320993280","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_DontShoot_0ab06b4","source":"Bestson: Костяшки болят, когда я прикасаюсь к ним. Я знаю, что это неправильно.","target":"Bestson: Mă dor încheieturile degetelor când le ating. Știu că nu e bine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14799,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452316798986","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_DontShoot_065d52f","source":"Bestson: Но я смотрю… и не понимаю... Не могу вспомнить, какими были их руки.","target":"Bestson: Dar mă uit… și nu înțeleg... Nu-mi amintesc cum arătau mâinile lor.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14800,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452316798985","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_DontShoot_0d194f0","source":"Bestson: А папа смеялся, что у меня его кулачища – крепкие, как у него в молодости.","target":"Bestson: Iar tata râdea și spunea că am pumnii lui mari și puternici, ca ai lui în tinerețe.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14801,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452316798984","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_DontShoot_0763e4d","source":"Bestson: Иногда я смотрю на них и думаю… а ведь мама говорила, что у меня её пальцы. Длинные, аккуратные.","target":"Bestson: Uneori mă uit la ele și mă gândesc… mama spunea că am degetele ei. Lungi, îngrijite.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14802,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452316798983","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_DontShoot_0833542","source":"Bestson: А я так и остался… таким.","target":"Bestson: Iar eu am rămas… așa.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14803,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452316798982","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_DontShoot_0187c54","source":"Bestson: Но их нет.","target":"Bestson: Dar ei nu mai sunt.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14804,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452316798981","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_DontShoot_0bee8f5","source":"Bestson: Они напомнили бы мне, заставили бы… Не дали бы мне так запустить себя…","target":"Bestson: Mi-ar fi amintit, m-ar fi făcut să… N-ar fi lăsat să mă neglijez atât…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14805,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452316798980","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_DontShoot_0b0f5a1","source":"Bestson: Может, если бы родители были рядом, всё было бы по-другому?","target":"Bestson: Poate, dacă părinții ar fi fost lângă mine, totul ar fi fost altfel?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14806,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452316798979","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_DontShoot_04e0a97","source":"Bestson: Поэтому у неё зубы испортились после меня, а у меня, наоборот, они стали вот такими вот хорошенькими! Только эти дёсны…","target":"Bestson: De aceea ei i s-au stricat dinții după ce m-a avut, iar ai mei, dimpotrivă, au ajuns atât de frumușei! Doar gingiile astea…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14807,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452316798978","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_DontShoot_077d7a2","source":"Bestson: Мама даже шутила, что я, пока она меня кормила грудью, весь её кальций высосал.","target":"Bestson: Mama chiar glumea că, atunci când mă alăpta, i-am supt tot calciul.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-374.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14808,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452316798977","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Ears_Gun_026fc83","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14809,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452316798976","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Ears_Gun_0976238","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14810,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452312604682","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Ears_Gun_0d5e187","source":"Bestson: Подожди… Это что, правда важно?","target":"Bestson: Stai… Chiar contează asta?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14811,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452312604681","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Photo_Gun_0499101","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14812,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452312604680","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Photo_Gun_013dcdc","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14813,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452312604679","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Photo_Gun_07f07f3","source":"Bestson: Дяденька, ну, пожалуйста…","target":"Bestson: Nene, te rog…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14814,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452312604678","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Armpit_Gun_0fbebd7","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14815,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452312604677","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Armpit_Gun_0b14c06","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14816,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452312604676","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Armpit_Gun_01fb5bc","source":"Bestson: Эй… Ты же не всерьёз из-за этого?!","target":"Bestson: Hei… Nu vorbești serios, doar din cauza asta?!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14817,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452312604675","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Eyes_Gun_032ac34","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14818,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452312604674","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Eyes_Gun_04547d4","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14819,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452312604673","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Eyes_Gun_08c399d","source":"Bestson: Стой! Я просто плохо сплю, вот и всё!","target":"Bestson: Stai! Doar dorm prost, atât!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14820,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452312604672","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Eyes_Gun_0d2a99f","source":"Bestson: Стой! Это просто из-за нервов, вот и всё!","target":"Bestson: Stai! E doar din cauza nervilor, atât!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14821,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452308410379","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_Gun_062f923","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14822,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452308410378","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_Gun_0acb27a","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14823,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452308410377","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_Gun_0b195ba","source":"Bestson: Эй, подожди, я же человек! Просто… нервный.","target":"Bestson: Hei, stai, sunt om! Doar că… sunt agitat.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14824,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452308410376","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_Gun_078fdc1","source":"Bestson: Эй, да что ты… Они ведь нормальные, да?","target":"Bestson: Hei, dar ce faci… Sunt normali, nu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14825,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452308410375","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_Gun_05092b0","source":"Выслушать","target":"Ascultă","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14826,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452308410374","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_Gun_056bd58","source":"Выстрелить","target":"Trage","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14827,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452308410373","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_Gun_0460397","source":"Bestson: Это же не признак, правда?","target":"Bestson: Ăsta nu e un semn, nu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14828,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452308410372","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_Gun_0aeb796","source":"Bestson: Эй… Я понимаю, что зубы не в лучшем состоянии, но…","target":"Bestson: Hei… Înțeleg că dinții mei nu sunt în cea mai bună stare, dar…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14829,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452308410371","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_Gun_009e729","source":"Bestson: Я слышал, что кто-то волосы выдирает, кто-то грызёт ногти, а я, наверное, ковыряю зубы. Но ведь это не страшно, да?","target":"Bestson: Am auzit că unii își smulg părul, alții își rod unghiile, iar eu probabil îmi scobesc dinții. Dar nu e grav, nu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14830,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452308410370","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_Gun_0d0cd5b","source":"Bestson: Эй… Ну будет тебе!","target":"Bestson: Hei… Hai, gata!","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14831,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452308410369","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Ears_0a20be6","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14832,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452308410368","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Ears_09f6eba","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14833,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452304216075","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Ears_0bfa06d","source":"Bestson: Я даже не знаю, что ты хочешь там увидеть…","target":"Bestson: Nici măcar nu știu ce vrei să vezi acolo…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14834,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452304216074","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Ears_07013da","source":"Bestson: ...","target":"Bestson: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
