{"ordinal":14836,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452304216072","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Photo_0fa3729","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14837,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452304216071","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Photo_0809710","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14838,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452304216070","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Photo_0fbd4a8","source":"Bestson: Какое-то странное фото. Это какой-то особый фотик, что ли?","target":"Bestson: Ce fotografie ciudată. E vreun aparat special?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14839,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452304216069","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Photo_03ed4b8","source":"Bestson: ...","target":"Bestson: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14840,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452304216068","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Photo_0273242","source":"Bestson: Ты хочешь сделать снимок? Ну, ладно… Только… просто скажи потом, что всё в порядке, хорошо?","target":"Bestson: Vrei să-mi faci o poză? Bine… Numai… spune-mi după aceea că totul e în regulă, da?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14841,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452304216067","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Armpit_06c0885","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14842,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452304216066","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Armpit_001583b","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14843,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452304216065","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Armpit_07c69c1","source":"Bestson: …","target":"Bestson: …","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14844,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452304216064","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Armpit_034e2ee","source":"Bestson: Родители не говорили, что надо. Вот я и не задумывался над этим…","target":"Bestson: Părinții nu mi-au spus că trebuie. Așa că nici nu m-am gândit la asta…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14845,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452300021771","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Armpit_0e2903e","source":"Bestson: Я их никогда не брил. Даже не думал об этом.","target":"Bestson: Nu i-am ras niciodată. Nici nu mi-a trecut prin cap.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14846,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452300021770","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Armpit_063a4c6","source":"Bestson: ...","target":"Bestson: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14847,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452300021769","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Armpit_000dfa0","source":"Bestson: Эм… Ну ладно.","target":"Bestson: Ăă… Bine.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14848,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452300021768","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Eyes_0e1b5e5","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14849,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452300021767","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Eyes_0ded7a3","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14850,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452300021766","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Eyes_0e7df58","source":"Bestson: Да вроде всё нормально… Хотя… последнее время немного щиплет, но, наверное, это просто… пыль… или аллергия…","target":"Bestson: Pare să fie totul în regulă… Deși… în ultima vreme mă ustură puțin, dar probabil e doar… praful… sau o alergie…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14851,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452300021765","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Eyes_0a2b631","source":"Bestson: Они зелёные. Это ведь нормально?","target":"Bestson: Sunt verzi. E normal, nu?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14852,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452300021764","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Eyes_01d3f00","source":"Bestson: ...","target":"Bestson: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14853,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452300021763","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Eyes_04ab7f5","source":"Bestson: А? Что с ними?","target":"Bestson: A? Ce-i cu ei?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14854,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452300021762","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_0eed880","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14855,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452300021761","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_0304cbe","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14856,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452300021760","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_0e32ea5","source":"Bestson: А костяшки… да так, неважно…","target":"Bestson: Iar încheieturile degetelor… ei, nu contează…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14857,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452295827467","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_00be6d0","source":"Bestson: Чёрт, да я совсем забыл о ногтях. Родители говорили мне стричь их, но я… так и не привык.","target":"Bestson: La naiba, am uitat cu totul de unghii. Părinții îmi spuneau să mi le tai, dar eu… nu m-am obișnuit niciodată.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14858,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452295827466","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_00dd556","source":"Bestson: Просто есть, и всё.","target":"Bestson: Sunt acolo, atâta tot.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14859,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452295827465","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_0de26b4","source":"Bestson: Я как-то не задумывался, какими они должны быть.","target":"Bestson: Nu m-am gândit niciodată cum ar trebui să arate.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14860,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452295827464","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_0d6d142","source":"Bestson: Обычные. Ну, наверное, обычные.","target":"Bestson: Obișnuiți. Cred că-s obișnuiți.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14861,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452295827463","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_074a187","source":"Bestson: ...","target":"Bestson: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14862,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452295827462","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Hands_0e219a7","source":"Bestson: Ой… Ну ладно…","target":"Bestson: Vai… Bine atunci…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14863,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452295827461","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_0bbdd96","source":"Достать ружьё","target":"Scoate pușca","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14864,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452295827460","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_0ea1ef1","source":"Отпустить","target":"Dă-i drumul","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-001.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14865,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452295827459","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_091a9dc","source":"Bestson: Ну… Я забываю. Иногда просто ложусь в постель, чтобы поскорее уснуть. Вдруг они вернутся…","target":"Bestson: Păi… uit. Uneori mă bag direct în pat, ca să adorm mai repede. Poate se întorc…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14866,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452295827458","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_06e6a24","source":"Bestson: Я не слишком за ними следил… Родители напоминали мне с детства чистить зубы перед сном, но после их исчезновения…","target":"Bestson: Nu prea am avut grijă de ei… Părinții îmi aminteau încă din copilărie să mă spăl pe dinți înainte de culcare, dar de când au dispărut…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14867,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452295827457","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_09d034d","source":"Bestson: Только вот дёсны иногда кровят. То ли из-за сахарного диабета, то ли из-за того, что я… переживаю.","target":"Bestson: Doar gingiile îmi sângerează uneori. Poate de la diabet, poate pentru că… îmi fac griji.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14868,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452295827456","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_0925460","source":"Bestson: Родители говорили, что у меня хорошая, эта… наследственность.","target":"Bestson: Părinții spuneau că am o ereditate… cum îi zice… bună.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14869,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452291633163","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_0466b50","source":"Bestson: ...","target":"Bestson: ...","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14870,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452291633162","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Bestson_Teeth_07feb4a","source":"Bestson: Ой, неужели так плохо? Ну ладно…","target":"Bestson: Vai, chiar arată atât de rău? Bine atunci…","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-375.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
